cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its figures, please cite it as below, and cite the underlying datasets named in data_sources.md."
title: "Experiencing the Anthropocene: code and figures"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived figures mapping how human-driven Earth-system
  transformations are encountered in daily life across Europe - heat stress,
  fine-particle air pollution, the built environment, night-sky brightness,
  road density and biosphere condition - together with the exposure filters
  that determine who meets which of them. Exploratory prototype work: results
  are provisional and have not been through the project's feature-ranking
  phase.
type: software

